137 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (I am so grateful to have you join me for this transformative 8-week leadership curriculum. At Garden City Church, our mission is to "Live the Life. Tell the Story." To truly live out this mission, it is essential that we, as leaders, master the art of communication. The way we use language has the power to inspire, influence, and guide those we lead. We cannot effectively tell our story, if we do not value our language and communication.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
