139 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Like any good relationship, health is built on trust, and trust is navigated through communication. The primary goal of "Language of a Leader" is to develop the leaders of Garden City Church in their communication skills and their ability to convey the most important message through the means of language. Effective communication is not just about speaking; it's about ensuring that our words align with our mission and values, and that they resonate deeply with our audience.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
