/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Clarity through language is a coveted and necessary skill for any leader. In a world filled with noise and distractions, clear and concise communication cuts through the chaos, bringing understanding and unity. When we communicate with clarity, we reduce misunderstandings, build trust, and create a strong foundation for effective ministry. Our ability to articulate our vision and values clearly will not only strengthen our leadership but also empower our community to live out the life and tell the story of Jesus Christ more effectively.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [6]
