>>
endobj
169 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Communication extends beyond words. It includes facial expressions, inflections, tone, sighs, and hand gestures. Our words are often influenced by thoughts, memories, emotions, childhood experiences, and both positive and negative experiences. Given the complexity of language, it's remarkable that people can interact effectively at all.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
