<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (One of the best-kept secrets among effective communicators is their practice of introspection. The Latin phrase "Nosce te ipsum," meaning "Know thyself," is a guiding principle for great communicators. They possess a deep understanding of their own insecurities, strengths, and contexts. This self-awareness is crucial, because it shapes the clarity and intentionality of their communication.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [0]
>>
