/E (Contemporary Christian leader and author, Dr. Charles Stanley, emphasizes the importance of grace-filled communication: "Our words should be a reflection of our relationship with Christ. They have the power to build up or tear down, to encourage or discourage. Speak with grace, as if the Lord Himself were speaking through you" \(Stanley, Charles. "The Power of Speaking God's Word"\).)
