384 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Grace-filled speech is not only a biblical mandate, but a powerful tool for Christian leaders, allowing us to reflect the love and character of Christ in our interactions. By balancing truth with love, controlling our tongues, pausing before responding, treating others with grace, and de-escalating conflict, we can communicate in a way that honors God and edifies others. Let us commit to speaking with grace, ensuring that our words are always a source of light and encouragement to those around us.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [13]
>>
